cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TILL, please cite it as below."
title: TILL
abstract: "TILL (Trusted Independent Ledger Library) is the agent-first, open-source ERP for Swiss SMEs: sales, purchasing, payments, stock, projects, books and MWST, every function exposed as an MCP tool, with a Studio that shows a person what the agent did. Local first, append-only ledger, QR-bill, ISO 20022."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Nomadik GmbH"
version: 1.0.0-beta.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tillbooks/tillbooks"
url: "https://tillbooks.ch"
keywords:
  - erp
  - accounting
  - switzerland
  - mcp
  - agent
  - local-first
  - double-entry-bookkeeping
